{"id":"9f15079e5487407f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Uniformity Meager Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Meager Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Meager Number","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number — ZFC CI Uniformity Meager Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}uniformity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S(\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\n\\land\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|X|=\\nu\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Meager}(X,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|Y|\\in\\nu\\to\\mathrm{Meager}(Y,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}uniformity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S(\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\n\\land\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|X|=\\nu\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Meager}(X,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|Y|\\in\\nu\\to\\mathrm{Meager}(Y,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The standard topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> is an explicit argument rather than a free ambient parameter.</li>\n<li>The uniformity number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{non}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{non}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> is the least size of a nonmeager subset of the real line.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$，见 [[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Meager}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}uniformity\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiUniformityMeagerNumber}_S(\\nu,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\n\\land\\exists X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|X|=\\nu\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Meager}(X,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(|Y|\\in\\nu\\to\\mathrm{Meager}(Y,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{non}(\\mathcal M)","display":false}],"bytes":1562,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ecb3b4164c43d4b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1620","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number.md|58-df-zfc-ci-uniformity-meager-number]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d816c9cae96d1191","5fb1c224